					"nextDialogs": [
						761270323
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 761270323,
					"content": "嗯…我们就在其中一个里面…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761270324
					],
					"speakerTitle": "黑蛋"
				},
				{
					"id": 761270324,
					"content": "「伊比尼伯龙之眼」具体是干什么的？",
